// Cowboy From Hell: completely bald, a dark brown ribbed tank top, silver chain and earrings, grey jeans, big brown
// cowboy boots with spurs and a whale tattoo on his left arm.
// Light: a punch that alternates arms while you spam it. Heavy: a leap with three kicks downwards.
// Special (the tattoo glows when the meter is full): curses the opponent with a glowing blue ring split into a left
// and a right half. Hitting them with any other attack from the left removes the left half, from the right the right
// half; with both gone the ring squeezes shut and deals the special's damage.
// See ayz.ron for what each field means; leap / leap_vx / hits / hit_gap / curse are explained in src/sim/data.rs.
(
    name: "Cowboy From Hell",
    subtitle: Some("Proud owner of real cattle"),
    sprites: Some("cowboy"),
    color: (0.85, 0.58, 0.32),
    walk_speed: 210,
    jump_speed: 1050,
    // a third less health than the others (667 of 1000)
    health: Some(667),
    // the special meter fills at 43% of the normal rate
    meter_gain_pct: Some(43),
    special_mark: Some(Scar(color: (0.25, 0.5, 0.85), glow: (0.35, 0.72, 1.0))),
    moves: [
        (name: "Punch", button: Light, crouching: false, anim: Punch, walk_pct: 60,
         startup: 4, active: 3, recovery: 7, damage: 30, hitstun: 12, blockstun: 8, knockback: 2, hitstop: 4,
         hitbox: (x: 12, y: 28, w: 27, h: 12)),
        (name: "Low Punch", button: Light, crouching: true, anim: Soft, walk_pct: 0,
         startup: 5, active: 3, recovery: 8, damage: 26, hitstun: 12, blockstun: 8, knockback: 2, hitstop: 4,
         hitbox: (x: 12, y: 0, w: 27, h: 12)),
        (name: "Dive Kicks", button: Heavy, crouching: false, anim: Kicks, walk_pct: 0,
         leap: 750, leap_vx: 150, hits: 3, hit_gap: 8, guard_hits: Some(3),
         startup: 6, active: 6, recovery: 12, damage: 28, hitstun: 14, blockstun: 8, knockback: 2, hitstop: 4,
         hitbox: (x: 2, y: -6, w: 32, h: 28)),
        (name: "Air Punch", button: Light, crouching: false, air: true, anim: Soft, walk_pct: 100,
